# Design docs, specs and plans are kept in a private project-docs repo and
# symlinked in; they are deliberately not published here. No trailing slash:
# `docs/` matches a directory, and this path is a SYMLINK, which git treats as
# neither — so the link itself would show up as untracked and be committable.
docs
